==Description==
The '''Basic Elf''' was an enemy that exclusively appeared in [[Cold Ambush]] as part of the [[Violent Night Event]]. It had an above average speed and an average health for its debut.

==Appearance==
The '''Basic Elf''' had pale skin. It had a green shirt with white fur along the sleeves, as well as stitch lines on the sides of the arms. It had a black belt, dark green pants and black shoes. It also wore a green Christmas hat.

==Strategy==
*Early game towers like the [[Golden Scout]], [[Cowboy]], [[Golden Cowboy]] or [[Crook Boss]] can do quite well against these.
*As these enemies spawn in large numbers, towers that can damage multiple enemies at once, such as the [[Executioner]], can be useful against this.

